  (rectangle (start 476 271.48) (end 561 379.62) (stroke (width 0.3) (type dash) (color 0 0 0 0)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 0056b4e8-2308-5e92-95ec-0f3ba325996c))
  (text "BUZZER" (at 479 276.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6c9c0e6e-81a7-5bda-82a6-2b5a3acee623))
  (text "SAFETY: pyros cannot fire until the XT30 ARM PLUG (J5) is inserted. R11 (47k) lets the Nano read continuity while DISARMED (<0.2 mA, far below no-fire)." (at 153 263.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 37bb7a5f-8210-5490-ac9a-bf81d446a277))
  (text "Every MOSFET gate has a 100k pull-down: channels stay OFF while the Nano boots/resets/is unplugged. CONTx drops to 0V when the igniter burns through = exact ignition time." (at 153 266.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 905fd169-d439-5f32-b5be-bd2515f9250a))
  (text "Power switch feeds logic through D1 into 470uF hold-up cap C1, so igniter current (5-12 A) sagging the LiPo cannot reset the Nano." (at 15 135.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e3826ed5-ed4d-560d-b582-66248a4aac31))
  (text "Servos have their own 5V/3A buck (U2) straight from the battery: servo stall current never touches the logic supply." (at 293 135.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 63dd2d06-d852-5100-8946-863fb95b8274))
  (text "BSS138 shifters keep a 5V classic Nano from over-driving the 3.3V sensors; transparent for a 3.3V Nano ESP32." (at 15 383.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 35e24e5c-0c3a-5c87-817c-96854c279128))
  (text "74LVC125 converts 5V SPI down to 3.3V for the card. Hinged-lid socket so the card cannot eject on landing." (at 228 383.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2fe51074-a067-5e2d-88e5-d58dbcb53890))
